---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

{# Hero #}
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="badge reveal">AI-Powered Relationship Intelligence</div>
        <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
            The AI that<br><span class="hero-gradient-text">truly knows you</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-2">Meet Julie — your personal relationship advisor who learns who you are, understands your people, and helps you show up better for the ones who matter.</p>
        <div class="store-buttons reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <a href="{{ site.playStoreUrl }}" class="store-button" target="_blank">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3.609 1.814L13.792 12 3.61 22.186a.996.996 0 0 1-.61-.92V2.734a1 1 0 0 1 .609-.92zm10.89 10.893l2.302 2.302-10.937 6.333 8.635-8.635zm3.199-3.199l2.302 2.302a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.38l-2.302 2.302L15.5 12l2.198-2.492zM5.864 2.658L16.8 8.99l-2.302 2.302-8.635-8.635z"/></svg>
                <div>
                    <span class="store-label">Get it on</span>
                    <span class="store-name">Google Play</span>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="store-button" target="_blank">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.8-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
                <div>
                    <span class="store-label">Download on the</span>
                    <span class="store-name">App Store</span>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# Meet Julie #}
<section class="julie-section-home" id="julie">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="julie-content">
            <div class="julie-text">
                <span class="section-label reveal">Meet Julie</span>
                <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">She already<br>knows you</h2>
                <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">Julie isn't a chatbot. She's an AI with genuine warmth who builds a deep, evolving understanding of who you are — your patterns, your strengths, what makes you tick.</p>
                <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3">The more you talk to her, the more she sees. She remembers what matters. She notices what you miss. And she helps you understand yourself in ways that change how you connect with everyone around you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="julie-visual reveal">
                <div class="julie-orb"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# Features #}
<section class="features-section" id="features">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-label reveal">Features</span>
            <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Everything you need to understand yourself and your people</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="features-phones">
            {# Chat with Julie #}
            <div class="feature-phone-item reveal">
                <div class="phone-container">
                    <div class="phone-frame">
                        <div class="screen">
                            {# Replace placeholder with: <img src="/assets/screenshot-chat.png" alt="Chat with Julie" class="screenshot"> #}
                            <div class="screen-placeholder">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
                                <span>Screenshot</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-right"></div>
                        <div class="buttons-left">
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-phone-label">
                    <h3>Talk to Julie</h3>
                    <p>A conversation that feels like talking to someone who truly sees you. She listens, remembers, and responds with real insight.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# Insights #}
            <div class="feature-phone-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
                <div class="phone-container">
                    <div class="phone-frame">
                        <div class="screen">
                            {# Replace placeholder with: <img src="/assets/screenshot-insights.png" alt="Your Insights" class="screenshot"> #}
                            <div class="screen-placeholder">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9" rx="1"></rect><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5" rx="1"></rect></svg>
                                <span>Screenshot</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-right"></div>
                        <div class="buttons-left">
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-phone-label">
                    <h3>Insights That Grow</h3>
                    <p>Every conversation becomes a living record. Patterns you'd never see on your own, surfaced automatically.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# Person Page #}
            <div class="feature-phone-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
                <div class="phone-container">
                    <div class="phone-frame">
                        <div class="screen">
                            {# Replace placeholder with: <img src="/assets/screenshot-person.png" alt="Person Page" class="screenshot"> #}
                            <div class="screen-placeholder">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
                                <span>Screenshot</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-right"></div>
                        <div class="buttons-left">
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                            <div class="button-left"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-phone-label">
                    <h3>Know Your People</h3>
                    <p>A living page for each person in your life. Understand how you connect, where things get stuck, and what to do about it.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# How It Works #}
<section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-label reveal">How It Works</span>
            <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Simple to start,<br>powerful over time</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Share who you are</h3>
                    <p>A few basics about yourself, and Julie starts reading you immediately. You'll be surprised what she picks up.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-1">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Add your people</h3>
                    <p>Tell Julie about the people who matter to you. She builds a profile for each one and starts mapping your dynamics.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-2">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Talk naturally</h3>
                    <p>Chat with Julie about your day, your relationships, what's on your mind. She listens, distills, and learns.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-3">
                <div class="step-number">4</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Watch it grow</h3>
                    <p>Your pages fill with insights. Julie surfaces patterns you'd never see on your own. The longer you use it, the more valuable it becomes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

